      "questionName": "coastline, planet, ocean, continent",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"115\"><strong>Complete the conversation, using the hints given.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"115\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"8\"><img src=\"/images/exams/Set_1_-_Planet_Earth_2_24d1fd5d.png\" alt width=\"500\"></strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"115\">Dan: Welcome to our class, everyone! Today, we are learning about the Earth. Let's begin with some simple questions. Emma, what makes the Earth different from other <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><input id='fbo-907506-0' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-907506-0' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907506-0' /></span></strong> in the solar system?&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"206\">Emma: Earth has land, water, and air, so people, animals, and plants can live here.</p>\n<p data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"314\">Dan: That&#8217;s correct! So what covers most of the Earth's surface?</p>\n<p data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"398\">Emma: The <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><input id='fbo-907506-1' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-907506-1' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907506-1' /></span></strong>&nbsp;covers most of Earth, and there are five of them.</p>\n<p data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"513\">Dan: Exactly! Earth also has seven large land areas. What do they call?</p>\n<p data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"597\">Emma: They are called <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><input id='fbo-907506-2' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-907506-2' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907506-2' /></span></strong>. Asia is the biggest one, and Antarctica is the coldest.</p>\n<p data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"708\">Dan: That&#8217;s right! Can you name some of the countries that have <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><input id='fbo-907506-3' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-907506-3' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907506-3' /></span></strong> in Asia?</p>\n<p data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"806\">Emma: China, Japan, Vietnam, and Thailand. Many people love visiting these countries for vacations.</p>\n<p data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"876\" data-is-last-node>Dan: That&#8217;s true! Thank you, Emma. Well done!</p>",
